#: .strings.DRONE_TIERINFO_GENERAL
msgid ""
"Combining Drones combines all their <style=cIsHealth>health</style> and "
"<style=cIsDamage>damage</style>, reduces <style=cIsUtility>skill cooldown</"
"style> by <style=cIsUtility>20%</style>, and adds an "
"<style=cIsUtility>additional effect</style> per tier."
msgstr ""
"Об'єднання дронів комбінує їх <style=cIsHealth>здоров'я</style> та "
"<style=cIsDamage>шкоду</style>, пришвидшує <style=cIsUtility>час "
"перезаряджання здібностей</style> на <style=cIsUtility>20%</style> та дає "
"<style=cIsUtility>додаткові ефекти</style> з кожним рівнем."

#: .strings.DRONE_GUNNER_TIERINFO
msgid "Fire <style=cIsDamage>2</style> extra bullets per tier."
msgstr ""

#: .strings.DRONE_HEALING_TIERINFO
msgid ""
"Healing beams last <style=cIsHealing>50%</style> longer, healing a total of "
"<style=cIsHealing>50%</style> more per tier."
msgstr ""

#: .strings.DRONE_HAULER_TIERINFO
msgid ""
"Increases <style=cIsUtility>movement speed</style> while grabbing by "
"<style=cIsUtility>60%</style> per tier."
msgstr ""

#: .strings.DRONE_JUNK_TIERINFO
msgid ""
"Drop <style=cIsTemporary>2</style> additional <style=cIsUtility>temporary "
"items</style> and <style=cIsUtility>reduce cooldown</style> by an additional "
"<style=cIsUtility>30%</style> per tier."
msgstr ""

#: .strings.DRONE_MISSILE_TIERINFO
msgid "Fire <style=cIsDamage>+2</style> extra missiles per tier."
msgstr ""

#: .strings.FLAMEDRONE_TIERINFO
msgid ""
"Flamethrower deals <style=cIsDamage>+1000%</style> more damage per tier."
msgstr ""

#: .strings.EMERGENCYDRONE_TIERINFO
msgid ""
"Can deploy <style=cIsHealing>+2</style> heal beams per tier. Healing beam "
"last <style=cIsHealing>+50%</style> longer and heal <style=cIsHealing>+50%</"
"style> more per second, per tier."
msgstr ""

#: .strings.DRONE_CLEANUP_TIERINFO
msgid ""
"Increase effect radius by <style=cIsUtility>6m</style> and generate "
"<style=cIsUtility>+1</style> pickup per tier."
msgstr ""

#: .strings.DRONE_JAILER_TIERINFO
msgid "Jails enemies for <style=cIsUtility>+5</style> seconds per tier."
msgstr ""

#: .strings.DRONE_RECHARGE_TIERINFO
msgid ""
"Charging beams last <style=cIsHealing>+50%</style> longer, overhealing a "
"total of <style=cIsHealing>50%</style> more per tier."
msgstr ""

#: .strings.DRONE_BOMBARDMENT_TIERINFO
msgid "Shock an additional <style=cIsDamage>+8</style> times per tier"
msgstr ""

#: .strings.DRONE_COPYCAT_TIERINFO
msgid ""
"Ice Disc bounces up to <style=cIsDamage>+6</style> additional times and "
"freezes for <style=cIsDamage>+1</style> seconds per tier"
msgstr ""

#: .strings.DRONE_MEGA_TIERINFO
msgid ""
"Bullet Barrage fires <style=cIsDamage>+8</style> heavy bullets per tier. "
"Fire <style=cIsDamage>+1</style> pair of explosive rockets per tier."
msgstr ""

#: .strings.SQUIDTURRET_SKILL_DESCRIPTION
msgid ""
"Fires ink at nearby enemies, dealing <style=cIsDamage>500%</style> damage "
"every <style=cIsDamage>0.75s</style>."
msgstr ""

#: .strings.FRIENDUNIT_SKILL_DESCRIPTION
msgid ""
"Rams itself into enemies, dealing <style=cIsDamage>400%</style> on light "
"foes and <style=cIsDamage>1000%</style> damage on heavy foes. Damage "
"increases with <style=cIsUtility>movement speed</style>"
msgstr ""

#: .strings.BEETLEGUARDALLY_SKILL_DESCRIPTION
msgid ""
"Slams nearby enemies for <style=cIsDamage>440%</style>damage.\n"
"Fires earth sunders dealing <style=cIsDamage>300%</style> damage."
msgstr ""

#: .strings.ROBOBALLREDBUDDY_SKILL_DESCRIPTION
msgctxt ".strings.ROBOBALLREDBUDDY_SKILL_DESCRIPTION"
msgid ""
"Fires a beam dealing <style=cIsDamage>100%</style> damage per second. Gains "
"increased <style=cIsDamage>damage</style> for each ally and item stack."
msgstr ""

#: .strings.ROBOBALLGREENBUDDY_SKILL_DESCRIPTION
msgctxt ".strings.ROBOBALLGREENBUDDY_SKILL_DESCRIPTION"
msgid ""
"Fires a beam dealing <style=cIsDamage>100%</style> damage per second. Gains "
"increased <style=cIsDamage>damage</style> for each ally and item stack."
msgstr ""

#: .strings.MINORCONSTRUCTONKILL_SKILL_DESCRIPTION
msgid ""
"Fires bouncing projectiles dealing <style=cIsDamage>150%</style> damage. "
"Gains <style=cIsUtility>200</style> armor while out of combat. "
"<style=cIsHealth>Expires</style> after 30 seconds, if owner is further than "
"100m away."
msgstr ""

#: .strings.NULLIFIERALLY_SKILL_DESCRIPTION
msgid ""
"Fires <style=cIsUtility>nullifying</style> void bubbles for "
"<style=cIsDamage>3x100%</style> damage.\n"
"Implodes <style=cIsHealth>on death</style>, killing ALL characters caught "
"<style=cIsHealth>instantly</style>."
msgstr ""

#: .strings.VOIDJAILERALLY_SKILL_DESCRIPTION
msgid ""
"Fires a shotgun of <style=cIsUtility>slowing</style> void spikes dealing "
"<style=cIsDamage>12x200%</style> damage.\n"
"Captures nearby enemies, <style=cIsUtility>nullifying</style> them for 2s.\n"
"Leaves a pursuing implosion <style=cIsHealth>on death</style>."
msgstr ""

#: .strings.VOIDMEGACRABALLY_SKILL_DESCRIPTION
msgid ""
"Fires a spread of white bombs for <style=cIsDamage>10x80%</style> damage, "
"followed by antimatter dealing <style=cIsDamage>600%</style> damage.\n"
"Antimatter explodes white bombs for an additional <style=cIsDamage>600%</"
"style> damage each.\n"
"Occasionally fires homing void missiles for <style=cIsDamage>14x30%</style> "
"damage.\n"
"Leaves a massive cascading Implosion <style=cIsHealth>on death</style>."
msgstr ""

#: .strings.ENGITURRET_SKILL_DESCRIPTION
msgid ""
"Rapidly fires bullets dealing <style=cIsDamage>70%</style> damage, for 200% "
"damage per second."
msgstr ""

#: .strings.ENGIWALKERTURRET_SKILL_DESCRIPTION
msgid ""
"Fires a beam that rapidly deals <style=cIsDamage>40%</style> damage, for "
"<style=cIsDamage>200%</style> damage per second."
msgstr ""

#: .strings.ITEM_SCRAPWHITE_PICKUP
msgid ""
"Does nothing. Prioritized when used with <color=#FAFAFA>3D Printers</color>."
msgstr ""

#: .strings.ITEM_SCRAPGREEN_PICKUP
msgid ""
"Does nothing. Prioritized when used with <style=cIsHealing>Large 3D "
"Printers</style>."
msgstr ""

#: .strings.ITEM_SCRAPRED_PICKUP
msgid ""
"Does nothing. Prioritized when used with <style=cIsHealth>Mili-Tech 3D "
"Printers</style>."
msgstr ""

#: .strings.ITEM_SCRAPYELLOW_PICKUP
msgid ""
"Does nothing. Prioritized when used with <style=cIsTierBoss>Overgrown 3D "
"Printers.</style>."
msgstr ""

#: .strings.ITEM_SCRAPWHITE_DESC
msgid ""
"Does nothing. Prioritized when used with <color=#FAFAFA>3D Printers</color> "
"and Cauldrons."
msgstr ""

#: .strings.ITEM_SCRAPGREEN_DESC
msgid ""
"Does nothing. Prioritized when used with <style=cIsHealing>Large 3D "
"Printers</style> and Cauldrons."
msgstr ""

#: .strings.ITEM_SCRAPRED_DESC
msgid ""
"Does nothing. Prioritized when used with <style=cIsHealth>Mili-Tech 3D "
"Printers</style> and Cauldrons."
msgstr ""

#: .strings.ITEM_SCRAPYELLOW_DESC
msgid ""
"Does nothing. Prioritized when used with <style=cIsTierBoss>Overgrown 3D "
"Printers</style>."
msgstr ""

#: .strings.ITEM_TONICAFFLICTION_DESC
msgid ""
"<color=#FF7F7F>Reduce ALL stats by -5% </color><style=cStack>(-5% per "
"stack)</style><color=#FF7F7F> when not under the effects of Spinel Tonic</"
"color>."
msgstr ""
"<color=#FF7F7F>Зменшує ВСІ характеристики на <style=cIsHealth>-5%</style> "
"<style=cStack>(-5% за кожен дублікат)</style><color=#FF7F7F> поки ви не під "
"ефектом «Шпінельного тоніка»</color>."

#: .strings.EQUIPMENT_QUESTVOLATILEBATTERY_DESC
msgid ""
"Falling below <style=cIsHealth>50% health</style> causes this to explode in "
"a large radius dealing <style=cIsDamage>300% the carriers maximum health as "
"damage</style>. Consumed on usage."
msgstr ""

#: .strings.EQUIPMENT_AFFIXRED_DESC
msgid ""
"Attacks <style=cIsDamage>ignite</style> enemies dealing "
"<style=cIsDamage>50%</style> TOTAL damage over time. Leave behind a "
"<style=cIsDamage>fire trail</style> dealing damage on contact."
msgstr ""

#: .strings.EQUIPMENT_AFFIXBLUE_DESC
msgid ""
"All attacks leave a <style=cIsDamage>lightning orb</style> which explodes "
"after <style=cIsUtility>1.5s</style> dealing <style=cIsDamage>50%</style> "
"TOTAL damage. Convert <style=cIsHealing>50%</style> of your "
"<style=cIsHealing>health</style> into <style=cIsHealing>shields</style>."
msgstr ""

#: .strings.EQUIPMENT_AFFIXWHITE_DESC
msgid ""
"<style=cIsUtility>Slow</style> enemies on hit for <style=cIsUtility>-80% "
"movement speed</style> for <style=cIsUtility>1.5s</style>. <style=cDeath>On "
"death</style> leave an <style=cIsDamage>ice explosion</style> "
"<style=cIsUtility>freezing</style> enemies for <style=cIsUtility>1.5s</"
"style>."
msgstr ""

#: .strings.EQUIPMENT_AFFIXPOISON_DESC
msgid ""
"Enemies hit will have their <style=cIsHealing>healing disabled</style> for "
"<style=cIsUtility>8s</style>. Periodically shoot out 3 "
"<style=cIsDamage>spike clusters</style> dealing <style=cIsDamage>100%</"
"style> base damage. <style=cDeath>On death</style> leave a "
"<style=cIsDamage>Malachite Urchin</style> lasting <style=cIsUtility>20s</"
"style>."
msgstr ""

#: .strings.EQUIPMENT_AFFIXHAUNTED_DESC
msgid ""
"<style=cIsUtility>Slow</style> enemies on hit for <style=cIsUtility>-80% "
"movement speed</style> for <style=cIsUtility>3s</style>. "
"<style=cIsUtility>Cloak</style> all allies in a large radius."
msgstr ""

#: .strings.EQUIPMENT_AFFIXLUNAR_DESC
msgid ""
"Increases <style=cIsHealing>maximum health</style> by <style=cIsHealing>25%</"
"style> and <style=cIsUtility>movement speed</style> by "
"<style=cIsUtility>30%</style>. \n"
"Convert all <style=cIsHealing>health</style> into "
"<style=cIsHealing>regenerating shields</style>. \n"
"<style=cIsDamage>Cripple</style> enemies on hit for <style=cIsUtility>4s</"
"style> reducing <style=cIsUtility>movement speed</style> by "
"<style=cIsUtility>100%</style> and <style=cIsDamage>armor</style> by "
"<style=cIsDamage>20</style>. \n"
"Periodically shoot out 4 orbs dealing <style=cIsDamage>30%</style> base "
"damage when attacking."
msgstr ""

#: .strings.EQUIPMENT_AFFIXEARTH_DESC
msgid ""
"<style=cIsHealing>Heal</style> a nearby hurt ally for "
"<style=cIsHealing>120%</style> of your <style=cIsDamage>base damage</style> "
"per second. <style=cDeath>On death</style> leave a <style=cIsHealing>Healing "
"Core</style> which will <style=cIsHealing>heal</style> all nearby creatures "
"after <style=cIsHealing>3s</style> "
msgstr ""

#: .strings.EQUIPMENT_AFFIXVOID_NAME
msgid "Voidborne Curiosity"
msgstr "Допитливість Порожнечі"

#: .strings.EQUIPMENT_AFFIXVOID_PICKUP
msgid "Become infested with void."
msgstr "Станьте зараженими порожнечею."

#: .strings.EQUIPMENT_AFFIXVOID_DESC
msgid ""
"Increases <style=cIsHealing>maximum health</style> by <style=cIsHealing>50%</"
"style>\n"
"Decreases <style=cIsDamage>base damage</style> by <style=cIsDamage>30%</"
"style>.\n"
"<style=cIsDamage>100%</style> chance to <style=cIsDamage>Collapse</style> "
"enemies on hit.\n"
"<style=cIsHealing>Block</style> incoming damage once every "
"<style=cIsUtility>15 seconds</style>. "
msgstr ""

#: .strings.EQUIPMENT_AFFIXAURELIONITE_DESC
msgid ""
"On hit, enemies will drop <style=cIsUtility>nuggets</style> worth "
"<style=cIsUtility>$8</style>. <style=cIsUtility>Scales over time.</style> "
"Upon activation or every <style=cIsDamage>12s</style>, launch a "
"<style=cIsDamage>eruption</style> dealing <style=cIsDamage>15% damage</"
"style> then <style=cIsDamage>150% damage.</style>"
msgstr ""

#: .strings.EQUIPMENT_AFFIXBEAD_DESC
msgid ""
"Buff <style=cIsHealing>5 nearby allies</style> in a <style=cIsHealing>35m</"
"style> radius, increasing their <style=cIsHealing>armor</style> by "
"<style=cIsHealing>300</style>. After buffed allies are hurt "
"<style=cIsHealing>10</style> times, fire a homing lunar spike dealing "
"<style=cIsDamage>100% damage</style> and inflicting <style=cIsDamage>Lunar "
"Ruin</style>. Recharges after 10s."
msgstr ""

#: .strings.EQUIPMENT_AFFIXCOLLECTIVE_DESC
msgid ""
"Gain a <style=cIsUtility>30m</style> dome that <style=cIsUtility>blocks</"
"style> all outside attacks and reduces <style=cIsUtility>skill cooldowns</"
"style> of all allies within by <style=cIsUtility>25%</style>.\n"
"Getting hit by a survivors skill, disables the dome for 8 seconds.\n"
"<style=cIsHealth>On Death</style>, explode for <style=cIsDamage>100%</style> "
"damage and disable items for <style=cIsDamage>2.5s</style>."
msgstr ""

